        "nobel_worthiness": "CAR-T therapy established a new mode of living-cell cancer treatment and has produced durable clinical benefit in otherwise refractory malignancies.",
        "attribution": "June, Sadelain, and Rosenberg are a coherent three-person attribution for pivotal development of engineered T-cell therapy.",
        "maturity": "Clinical efficacy, regulatory adoption, and continuing extension across hematologic cancers provide substantial maturity.",
        "uncertainties": [
