        "attribution": "Benabid is presented as the sole credited contributor, allowing unusually direct attribution for the stated therapeutic advance.",
        "maturity": "Decades of clinical use and extensive confirmation of benefit support mature recognition.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The intervention is most effective for selected motor complications and does not halt neurodegeneration."
        ]
      }
    },
