        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett offer a compact attribution spanning splicing biology and antisense therapeutic development.",
        "maturity": "Clinical benefit is established, including in presymptomatic treatment, though long-term outcome data continue to accrue.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The degree to which benefits persist across all disease stages and genotypes requires continued follow-up."
        ]
      }
